ut lineup FE and the same-shooter placebo on other play types is -0.0071/-0.0075, consistent with shooter-level confound.\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: artifact_found"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-076", "score": 0.098, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-076 | Study family SF-APPS-076: Trigger attribution: variance of H1->H2 PPP collapse\n- observed_research_question: Trigger attribution: variance of H1->H2 PPP collapse\n- auto_outcome_status: rejected\n- observed_hypothesis: Observable in-game process/usage/shot-selection/lineup/context changes explain suppression triggers beyond RTM.\n- observed_result: RTM (ppp_h1 alone) 32.9% of variance. Usage +0.0%; process+shot-zone +1.7%; lineup +0.0%; context +0.0%. Unexplained 65.4%. Total explained 34.6% (RTM=95% of explained).\n- auto_failure_mechanism: B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)\n- observed_failure_evidence: Process/usage/lineup/context add ~1.7 pp; residual 65.4% is idiosyncratic noise from small per-half n.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=40963 cells; 12617 triggers\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPS-070\n- observed_verdict: null\n- observed_failure_type: B_powered_null\n- auto_confidence: high (0.95)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-125"}, {"id": "FAM:SF38", "score": 0.081, "document": "# FAM:SF38 | Study family SF38: Defensive in-game adaptation to repeated play type (exposure slope)\n- observed_research_question: Defensive in-game adaptation to repeated play type (exposure slope)\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: An action gets less effective the more often the defense has already seen it in the game.\n- observed_result: [CHT-065] League-wide within-game -0.0019 PPP/exposure (SE 0.0019); across-game +0.0004 (SE 0.0015); H1 exposures to H2 -0.0000 (SE 0.0024). After 5 exposures, effects >~0.02 ruled out. Only PULL_UP within-game -0.030 SE [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- observed_result: [TMP-008] Linear slope Spec A -0.0019 (0.0019), Spec B +0.0004 (0.0015); only PULL_UP survives Holm (B -0.0243 (0.0061), holm 0.0004); team trait split-half r +0.008, season-to-season +0.037.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: none (no failure recorded)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:insufficient_exposure\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:low_measurement_reliability"}], "n_results": 4}

