      "estimand": "The causal effect of an offensive lineup change (at least one player substitution) on the subsequent distribution of shot types, compared to the distribution in the immediately preceding possessions within the same game, after controlling for game-state confounders. The primary estimand is the average treatment effect across all such changes, with a secondary examination of heterogeneity by player quality discrepancy.",
